Description: Confirm SIMTech PCM selection and serialize audio transitions
 Publish candidate metadata only after fixed selection ACK and exact readback.
 Retain physical response ownership across supersession and fail closed on
 uncertain transport lifetime. This does not qualify firmware USB framing.
Author: yoyopod contributors
Origin: other, yoyopod
Forwarded: not-needed
